{
  "id": "u12-l01",
  "unit": "u12-have-to",
  "title": "To do, to go",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**The -তে form is the 'to …' of Bengali.** Take the আমি present, drop **-ই** and add **-তে**:\n\n- করি → **করতে** 'to do'\n- পড়ি → **পড়তে** 'to read'\n- শুনি → **শুনতে**, থাকি → **থাকতে**\n\nTwo break the rule, as in the future: খাই → **খেতে**, যাই → **যেতে**.\n\nThe -তে form never changes for the person. It comes **before** the verb that carries the ending: **আমি বই পড়তে চাই** 'I want to read a book', **সে রান্না করতে পারে** 'she can cook'.\n\nAfter a verb of going it means 'to, in order to': **মাছ কিনতে বাজারে যাব** 'I'll go to the market to buy fish'.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "korte",
      "bn": "করতে",
      "tr": "korte",
      "en": "to do",
      "notes": "Infinitive of করা: কর- + -তে. Same spelling as তুমি করতে \"you used to do\", met later."
    },
    {
      "id": "jete",
      "bn": "যেতে",
      "tr": "jete",
      "en": "to go",
      "notes": "Infinitive of যাওয়া. Irregular: যাই → যেতে (like খাই → খেতে)."
    },
    {
      "id": "ashte",
      "bn": "আসতে",
      "tr": "ashte",
      "en": "to come",
      "notes": "Infinitive of আসা. Do not confuse with আস্তে (aste) \"slowly\"."
    },
    {
      "id": "porte",
      "bn": "পড়তে",
      "tr": "porte",
      "en": "to read",
      "notes": "Infinitive of পড়া."
    },
    {
      "id": "kinte",
      "bn": "কিনতে",
      "tr": "kinte",
      "en": "to buy",
      "notes": "Infinitive of কেনা; the stem is কিন- as in কিনব."
    },
    {
      "id": "thakte",
      "bn": "থাকতে",
      "tr": "thakte",
      "en": "to stay",
      "notes": "Infinitive of থাকা."
    },
    {
      "id": "shunte",
      "bn": "শুনতে",
      "tr": "shunte",
      "en": "to listen",
      "notes": "Infinitive of শোনা; the stem is শুন- as in শুনবে."
    }
  ],
